        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom own-door apartment to the market in the ever-popular Summerseat development, Clonee.\nSummerseat is a secluded, low-density residential development renowned for its beautifully landscaped communal grounds, abundance of open green spaces and welcoming community atmosphere. Ideally positioned within walking distance of Clonee Village, residents enjoy a fantastic selection of local shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities on their doorstep. The area continues to grow in popularity, while nearby Dunboyne and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre provide an even greater range of retail, dining and leisure facilities. Families and professionals alike are exceptionally well catered for with a choice of excellent primary and secondary schools, crèches and sporting amenities all within easy reach. Residents are spoiled for choice with nearby golf clubs, GAA clubs, Dunboyne Tennis Club, gyms, woodland walks and a host of recreational facilities close by. The location is further enhanced by immediate access to the N3 and M50 motorway networks, making commuting to Dublin City Centre and beyond exceptionally convenient.\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation extending to approximately c. 72 sq.m briefly comprises an entrance hallway, a generous open plan living and dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, two well-proportioned double bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a modern family bathroom.\nNo. 28 comes to the market in excellent condition throughout having been recently renovated to a high standard. The property boasts a stylish, contemporary interior with beautifully upgraded bathrooms featuring brand-new floor and wall tiling, creating a fresh and modern finish. Further benefits include an own-door entrance, gas fired central heating and a C BER rating. The annual management fee is approximately 600 per annum.\nThis fantastic property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike seeking a stylish, turnkey home in a mature and highly convenient location.\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest and arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n• BER C Rated\n• C. 72 sq.m\n• Two bed / two bath own-door apartment\n• Turnkey condition throughout\n• Recently renovated to a high standard\n• Stylish modern interior\n• Brand-new floor and wall tiling in both bathrooms\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Well-maintained low-density development\n• Beautifully landscaped communal grounds\n• Ample green open spaces\n• Management fee c. 600 per annum\n• Walking distance to Clonee Village\n• Close to schools, crèches and local amenities\n• Blanchardstown Shopping Centre within easy reach\n• Easy access to the N3 & M50 motorway networks\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors\n• Early viewing strongly advised"
      },
